  with our Michael D. Green Lecturer\, Lokosh (Joshua D. Hinson) a citizen 
 of the Chickasaw Nation\, ahead of his talk that evening. We will be in th
 e Garden from 11:00 AM - 2:00 PM. \n\n \n\nA fluent speaker of the Chickas
 aw language\, poet\, and an award-winning artist\, he holds a PhD in Nativ
 e Language Revitalization from the University of Oklahoma. He writes and m
 akes art on the Chickasaw Nation Reservation\, Ada\, Oklahoma.
