DESCRIPTION:Burnout is a growing concern for many employers\, as it can imp
 act morale\, employee retention\, work productivity and more. In this sess
 ion\, we describe the signals that leaders can watch for and introduce str
 ategies to help them prevent burnout from impacting the workforce.\n\nClic
 k on Carolina Talent registration link and select the “Request” button
  to automatically enroll.
