DESCRIPTION:UNC-Chapel Hill will rededicate the UNC War Memorial to add nam
 es to its bronze Book of Names honoring alumni who died during service. Th
 e ceremony of rembrance\, reflection and gratitude is hosted by the Caroli
 na Veterans Alumni Network and will feature remarks from Rear Adm. Kristin
  Acquavella '93.\n\n \n\nDedicated in2007\, the memorial gave Carolina its
  first campus site honoring alumni lost in conflicts beyond the Civil War 
 and World War I\, which Memorial Hall commemorates. The original Book of N
 ames listed 684 alumni from the Civil War through the Gulf War and was des
 igned with space to add names identified later.
