 ue offers a glimpse into the quality and variety of the students’ resear
 ch\, projects\, and performances. Come learn about the collection and see 
 it anew through their short\, dynamic presentations. \nFree public program
 \; no registration required. \n  \nThe Ackland Semester Revue is part of U
 NC-Chapel Hill’s Campus Life Experience program. Scan the QR code at the
  event for CLE credit.
