DESCRIPTION:The 36th Annual Jingle Bell Jog is right around the corner! Joi
 n for a little holiday fun and some friendly competition.\n\n \n\nChoose b
 etween a 2.7-mile fun run or a 1.5-mile walk. Costumes are encouraged\, an
 d there will be refreshments\, prize drawings and awards for the most spir
 ited team and most creative costumes.\n\n \n\nThe tradition of giving back
  continues. Bring non-perishable food items for the UNC Carolina Cupboard 
 and pet supplies for local animal shelters.\n\n \n\nCheck-in is from 11:30
 -noon\, with a participant meeting at noon. The walk/run starts at 12:15 p
 .m. Free refreshments will be provided for participants after the event.\n
 \n \n\nRegister for the Jingle Bell Jog.
