DESCRIPTION:Run by Launch Chapel Hill\, Launch Triangle is the Triangle’s
  first cross-university commercialization accelerator\, bringing together 
 research-born ventures from UNC-Chapel Hill\, Duke\, and NC State. From Ja
 nuary through March\, these teams will sharpen their commercial thinking a
 nd build the path from lab to market.\n\n \n\nAnd what better way to start
  than by celebrating the mentors who’ve supported our founders all year 
 through Mentor Mornings? Each team will share a quick introduction to what
  they’re building\, and then we’ll raise a glass to our mentors.\n\n \
 n\nWhether you’re a founder\, investor\, industry expert\, or someone wh
 o loves learning about frontier innovation\, come meet the cohort and find
  out how you can help. Heavy hors d’oeuvres\, beer and wine will be serv
 ed.\n\n \n\nCome celebrate with us. RSVP now to reserve your spot!
